{
  "about": "Release-over-release performance of HIDMaestro on the development laptop, a Lenovo Legion Pro 7 16AFR10H. Each step is the side-by-side comparison published in that release's notes, written by tools/perf_from_notes.py. tools/build_perf.py draws performance.html and the home and press sections from this file.",
